            <font size="-1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b><br>
            AMD Athlon™ XP Processor Overview</b><br>
            The <font color="#CC0000">AMD Athlon™ XP</font> processor with 
            <font color="#CC0000">QuantiSpeed™ architecture</font> powers 
            the next generation in computing platforms, delivering extra performance 
